{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"南韓女團成員張員瑛主持香港迪士尼樂園聖誕樹亮燈儀式\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/DISNEY-XMAS-261116-19.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】香港迪士尼樂園明天起推出一系列聖誕主題活動。</p><p>南韓人氣女團成員張員瑛在美國小鎮大街主持聖誕樹亮燈儀式，無人機拼出不同節日圖案，吸引不少人用手機拍攝。魔雪奇緣園區亦掛上聖誕裝飾，設有冬日市集售賣聖誕限定商品，樂園除夕亦會舉辦倒數活動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.524769+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:11:50.942527+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:50.616634+00:00","content_hash":"e5b9ff95f7fd04e22b69035e3d277f216e18de39408ed8c5f901ca68cd6e8783","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.524769+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}